{"suttaId":"thag4.9","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1439,1451],"vripara":"299"},"segments":{"thag4.9:0.4":"Candanattheragāthā","thag4.9:1.1":"“Jātarūpena sañchannā [pacchannā (sī.)], dāsīgaṇapurakkhatā;","thag4.9:1.3":"Aṅkena puttamādāya, bhariyā maṃ upāgami.","thag4.9:2.1":"“Tañca disvāna āyantiṃ, sakaputtassa mātaraṃ;","thag4.9:2.3":"Alaṅkataṃ suvasanaṃ, maccupāsaṃva oḍḍitaṃ.","thag4.9:3.1":"“Tato me manasīkāro, yoniso udapajjatha;","thag4.9:3.3":"Ādīnavo pāturahu, nibbidā samatiṭṭhatha.","thag4.9:4.1":"“Tato cittaṃ vimucci me, <b>passa dhammasudhammataṃ;</b>","thag4.9:4.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti.","thag4.9:4.5":"… Candano thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
